1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,714
One band proved your blood goes round.

2
00:00:02,824 --> 00:00:06,753
William Harvey tied it tight round a man's arm.

3
00:00:06,763 --> 00:00:08,290
The hand went cold.

4
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:10,103
No blood was getting in.

5
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:12,717
He loosened it, just a little.

6
00:00:12,917 --> 00:00:16,302
The veins below the band swelled up like ropes.

7
00:00:16,567 --> 00:00:21,287
So blood goes in through the arteries, and comes home through the veins.

8
00:00:21,383 --> 00:00:22,941
Look at your hand.

9
00:00:23,018 --> 00:00:25,258
That blood is heading home now.

